# PipelineShield Live GitHub Actions Ingestion Configuration
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN:
# A GitHub Personal Access Token (classic or fine-grained) used server-side
# by /api/latest-report to discover workflow runs and download the
# 'security-summary-reports' artifact zip.
#
# Required Scopes:
#   - Fine-grained token:
#       * Repository permissions: Actions (Read), Metadata (Read)
#   - Classic token:
#       * 'repo' or 'public_repo' (for public repositories)
#
# Security notice:
# NEVER commit real tokens. This value is read server-side only and
# is never exposed to browser clients or NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# GITHUB_REPOSITORY:
# Target repository in 'owner/repo' format.
# Defaults to "YogamruthReddy/PipelineShield" if omitted.
GITHUB_REPOSITORY=YogamruthReddy/PipelineShield

